tables compiled by the author) is licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Third-party coefficients retain their original licences and are attributed
in the `source` column of each CSV. In particular, instance power figures
derive from the Teads Engineering EC2 dataset (Davy, 2021), CC BY 4.0.
